"A path a test narrowed, `(car x)`, read again after a write to the region
 it reads through: the write may have changed it, so it is a union's again;
 refused, as Fixpt refuses it (C196)."
(define-effect kfx (maxeff (read @globals) spin))
(define-type v (union int string))
(define-type cell (pairof v int @r))
(define* f (subr (maxeff (read @r) (write @r)) (cell (ref int @r)) int)
  (lambda (x b) (if (int? (car x)) (begin (set b 1) (+ (car x) 1)) 0)))
(define main (subr kfx () i64) (lambda () 0))
